{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2018-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1527811200, "end_date": 1528415999, "month_true_total": 90, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:14:44 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "42560528", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049403761", "personaname": "terfhunter92", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/terfhunter92/", "num_games_owned": 164, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 3875, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1382, "last_played": 1597820795, "avatar": "504728159d86af7dfe8b168252a10447e87c8d11"}, "language": "english", "review": "Hard as balls but a very fun game nonetheless.", "timestamp_created": 1528395114, "timestamp_updated": 1528395114, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42545667", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044937829", "personaname": "SpicyBeanDip", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LifesContradict/", "num_games_owned": 1122, "num_reviews": 103, "playtime_forever": 3186, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2862, "last_played": 1593480526, "avatar": "390ad1cf174604d2273e0c527dff8970db792144"}, "language": "english", "review": "SO MUCH YES.\n\nLook, it's one of those games you immediately love, or one of those games you immediately hate. I could put points up, pros and cons... But honestly, Just play it for an hour and a half, solo. And if you don't like it, then no amount of trying to configure multiplayer and play with others is going to make you like the game.\n\nMy only regret is that I was never as good as I wanted to be, and that I get mad so easily.\n\nHopoo games has my respect for what this game is, and has been through and the limits it was pushed to with the knowledge they had making it. Worth every penny.", "timestamp_created": 1528339450, "timestamp_updated": 1528339450, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42541264", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063166989", "personaname": "Der Marshall", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198063166989/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 3267, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2884, "last_played": 1536956597, "avatar": "47c9ad099b0b3937b08da1cc66398df71f6dff74"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, with nice pixelart, tons of content and fun online coop. Very challenging gameplay through the increasing difficulty over time. Building character can be very complex and rewarding since you can beat the game multiple times in one run. Combining powerups is super fun! Definitely recommended!", "timestamp_created": 1528319918, "timestamp_updated": 1528319918, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42522211", "author": {"steamid": "76561198239636168", "personaname": "Simon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198239636168/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 2448, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1668, "last_played": 1746939709, "avatar": "0caf4d7e39c418397978e109e5f07b1c6bfa4fb1"}, "language": "english", "review": "After 25 hours, I beat the game. 60% completed. The game is difficult, so if that's your thing, then have fun. The game is mainly luck based, but put the cards you're dealt to best use and you'll be fine. Risk of Rain is awesome.", "timestamp_created": 1528256044, "timestamp_updated": 1528256044, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42521524", "author": {"steamid": "76561198123694251", "personaname": "StephDee007", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198123694251/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 64, "playtime_forever": 843, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 245, "last_played": 1549743223, "avatar": "082b719b3a875dff64f23361a50e3349d363b196"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's buggy but it's fun. The pairing of the difficultly level with the time is a fantastic idea and it's well executed. There's a decent variety of enemies and a surprisingly large amount of items. When it works the online play is great with friends. The characters are all unique and unlocking them is a good challenge. It's just buggy. Sometimes it just doesn't work.", "timestamp_created": 1528252634, "timestamp_updated": 1528252634, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}